Metric:
- id: availability.incidents
- name: 
- description: This metric measures the count of Severity 1 and 2 incidents affecting cloud services, which are critical to operational continuity. It includes the mean time to restore (MTTR), indicating the average duration taken to resolve these incidents and restore services to normal functioning. Additionally, it tracks the hours during which service level objectives (SLOs) are breached, reflecting the impact on service reliability and user experience. The scope encompasses all major incidents that disrupt service availability, providing insights into operational performance and areas for improvement. By analyzing these metrics, organizations can enhance incident response strategies and improve overall service reliability.

